        <body>
            <div xml:id="d673">

                <pb facs="1068" n="972" xml:id="pg972"/>

                <head>No. 671.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Sickles to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-12-03T18:00:00-00:14"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi>
                            3, 1873—6 p.m.</date> (Received 9 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>President Castelar informs me now that powers have been sent this afternoon to
                    Spanish minister in Washington to negotiate the place, day, and hour of the
                    delivery of the Virginius to United States.</p>
                <closer><signed>SICKLES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
